    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude8c <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, dodge, and dominate the highway!</strong><br>Get behind the wheel of a high-speed highway bus and experience the thrill of endless racing in <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong>. Complete daring missions, collect fuel, overtake traffic, and push your limits in multiple game modes and dynamic environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Near\u2011Miss King</strong> \u2013 Skim past cars and rack up style points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Grab</strong> \u2013 Collect fuel tanks before the gauge hits empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Hold</strong> \u2013 Keep the needle buried for the target duration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distance Sprint</strong> \u2013 Cover a set distance before the clock expires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong\u2011Way Dare</strong> \u2013 Hit top speed while carving through on\u2011coming lanes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Career Mode with 50 Levels</strong><br>Rise through the ranks with unique challenges at every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Infinite Mode (Sunny, Night, Rainy)</strong><br>Endless racing in changing weather and lighting conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Free Mode</strong><br>Drive at your own pace and enjoy the environment with no restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Easy to Play, Hard to Master</strong><br>Perfect for casual players and racing pros alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the highest score, enjoying a calm free ride, or blasting through traffic in a time attack, <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong> delivers non-stop action and speed on the open road.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude8c <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, dodge, and dominate the highway!</strong><br>Get behind the wheel of a high-speed highway bus and experience the thrill of endless racing in <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong>. Complete daring missions, collect fuel, overtake traffic, and push your limits in multiple game modes and dynamic environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Near\u2011Miss King</strong> \u2013 Skim past cars and rack up style points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Grab</strong> \u2013 Collect fuel tanks before the gauge hits empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Hold</strong> \u2013 Keep the needle buried for the target duration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distance Sprint</strong> \u2013 Cover a set distance before the clock expires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong\u2011Way Dare</strong> \u2013 Hit top speed while carving through on\u2011coming lanes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Career Mode with 50 Levels</strong><br>Rise through the ranks with unique challenges at every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Infinite Mode (Sunny, Night, Rainy)</strong><br>Endless racing in changing weather and lighting conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Free Mode</strong><br>Drive at your own pace and enjoy the environment with no restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Easy to Play, Hard to Master</strong><br>Perfect for casual players and racing pros alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the highest score, enjoying a calm free ride, or blasting through traffic in a time attack, <strong>Highway Bus Rush</strong> delivers non-stop action and speed on the open road.</p>",
    "short_description": "Highway Bus Rush is a fast-paced endless racing game with mission-based gameplay. Drive a highway bus, complete 50 levels, collect fuel, dodge traffic, and race through Sunny, Night, and Rainy modes at top speed.",
